{"id":"2b154a192a45d3ed","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-provable.md","title":"Provable","display":"df-provable — Provable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-provable","aliases":["17-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Provable","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-formula]]","[[17-df-deduction-system]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2db01209d2aa1bcd\" href=\"?note=2db01209d2aa1bcd\" title=\"17-df-deduction-system\">17-df-deduction-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\in\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\">\\(\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\in\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)\\)</span> (Hilbert system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2db01209d2aa1bcd\" href=\"?note=2db01209d2aa1bcd\" title=\"17-df-deduction-system\">17-df-deduction-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (premise set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L\\)</span> (conclusion formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"465b5002eb16d1cf\" href=\"?note=465b5002eb16d1cf\" title=\"17-df-formula\">17-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,i,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m,i,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in i^m\">\\(j\\in i^m\\)</span> 是先前行号的有限序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^n\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^n\\)</span> (finite formula sequence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span> (derivation predicate, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\)</span> (derivability relation, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^n\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\bigl[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in i^m\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\n((\\langle\\pi(j(k)):k&lt;m\\rangle,\\pi(i))\\in r)\\bigr]\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^{n+1}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land\\pi(n)=\\varphi),\\\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(&amp;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^n\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\bigl[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists j\\in i^m\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathrm{Rules}\\;\n((\\langle\\pi(j(k)):k&lt;m\\rangle,\\pi(i))\\in r)\\bigr]\\bigr),\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L^{n+1}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Deriv}_{\\mathcal H}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\land\\pi(n)=\\varphi),\\\\\n\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi,\\\\\n\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal H}\\varphi.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则实例的前提指标可重复且可按任意次序排列，但必须严格早于当前行。零前提规则由空元组覆盖。推导只使用固定系统的实际规则，不把一般框架自动认作完整的一阶逻辑。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-deduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"2db01209d2aa1bcd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-deduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-deduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"2db01209d2aa1bcd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\in\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)$ (Hilbert system, see [[17-df-deduction-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L$ (premise set, see [[17-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"465b5002eb16d1cf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_L$ (conclusion formula, see [[17-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\in\\mathrm{HilbertSystems}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_L","display":